==Rules==
* 2 Qualifiers
* Top 5 in each group advances to Grand Final
* 6 maps: DM2, Death32c, Ultrav, ZTNDM4, E1M2, DM3
* Timelimit: 10
* Powerups: ON
* DropQuad: ON
* Client: ezQuake
* Ruleset: Smackdown/Qcon
* Prizes based on donations
* Tiebrakers are based on frag count
* In case of tie of frags on map, both players get the upper position points. For example, first and second tie, both get 5 points
